        "request_sha256 binds the resolved request, canonical workspace and Controller independently of live sources; workspace aliases and the validated expected workspace ID are excluded",
        "normalized_identity_sha256 binds the JCS representation of the full accepted intent",
        "Caller and legacy reservations share one create-exclusive allocation key namespace; conflicting generations cannot allocate a second Run"
      ]
    },
